== Effects ==
* Copies the effect of the most recently used [[Pill]], [[Card]], [[Rune]], [[Soul Stone]], or [[activated item]].

== Notes ==
* Being a [[special card]], the '''Wild Card''' has a significantly lower chance of appearing compared to other cards.
* Using {{p|Jera}} on a Wild Card will copy the Wild Card, allowing Isaac to infinitely copy any other consumables in the room.
* Using {{i|Diplopia}} will copy the Wild Card and any pedestal item in the room, allowing Isaac to infinitely copy any item in the room.

== Synergies ==
* {{i|Plan C}}: Activating the Plan C effect resets Isaac's 3 second death timer, allowing for longer boss death animations to play out.
** {{dlc|r+}} Bosses with longer death animations now make Plan C's cooldown longer, therefore making this strategy a little less useful.

== Trivia ==
* The Wild Card comes from [[wikipedia:Uno (card game)|Uno]]. In Uno, this card allows whoever played it to choose its color.

